Z||000000||Wolfhound||11-19-2000||06:34 AM||||I drive a Blue 87 GT and an 86 Ford pickup.<BR>A couple of weeks ago, several confusing incidents began to occur.<BR> Several friends mentioned that, they had seen me in various locations, that I was nowhere near at the time. On occasion it almost became an argument, with them saying that I just didn't remember and had waved as they met me.<BR>This became so frequent that figured there had to be another Blue Gt around Auburn Alabama.<BR> Well, I finally met the GT on the road, My first impression was someone had stolen my car. I have now spotted it twice and guess what I was driving both times, yep, the pickup.<BR> I wonder if he is getting the same stories from his friends? It,s hard to believe the two cars haven't shown up at the same place, there are only about 25,000 people in Auburn.<BR> If I can corner him, I,ll point him to the Forum.  <p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 11-19-2000).]||||reg||5
